@startuml
|Web Server|
start
:Detect load spike;
if (Cannot handle workload?) then (yes)
:Send initialization request;
|Mediator|
:Receive initialization request;
:Obtain resource and access info;
|Service Registry|
:Provide resource and service info;
|Mediator|
:Obtain SLA and policies;
|Policy Repository|
:Provide SLA and policies;
|Mediator|
:Generate service requirements;
:Pass service requirements;
