:Discover external resources;
if (Preexisting peering arrangements?) then (yes)
:Return existing arrangements;
else (no)
:Negotiate short-term peering;
endif

|Mediator|
if (Sufficient peer resources acquired?) then (yes)
:Configure peering protocols;
|Peering Agent|
:Advertise CDN configurations;
:Exchange content availability info;
